Claim (Black magic) --- The points V , N, R' are collinear.
Proof. We use tethered moving points with \bigtriangleupDEF fixed.
Obviously the map \omega 7\toEF 7\to\omega by M 7\toN 7\toR'N \cap\omega is projective. Also, the map
