new rooted tree T2 where each red circle is joined to the red circle below it if there was
a path of (zero or more) white circles in T1 between them. Then each red circle has at
most 2 direct descendants in T2. Hence the depth of the new tree T2 exceeds log2(n),
which produces the desired path.
