Let A2 = BC1 \capCB1, B2 = CA1 \capAC1, C2 = AB1 \capBA1. Prove that if triangle
A1B1C1 is scalene, then the circumcircles of triangles AA1A2, BB1B2, and CC1C2
all pass through two common points.
